# Vendored third-party checkouts. Cloned on demand by scripts/lib/deps.sh
# from deps/deps.list — see AGENTS.md "Vendored Deps".
#
# Anything dropped into deps/ is gitignored by default; the only tracked
# entries are this file and the explicit allowlist below.
*
!.gitignore
!deps.list
!libhybris-shims/
!libhybris-shims/**
!xwayland-patches/
!xwayland-patches/**
!mesa-patches/
!mesa-patches/**
!gfxstream-patches/
!gfxstream-patches/**
!rutabaga-patches/
!rutabaga-patches/**
!smithay-patches/
!smithay-patches/**
